From 07838442462e0423439376615e0d160cfa2f31cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dogty <dogty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 22:45:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] build, CI and docs for the relay; relay test tool
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

移植 e5fc404,并把 aylz10 前置 CI 修复(2748c48、5a87a46)一并纳入,
工作流在本 fork 现有版本上适配(保留 actions/checkout@v6 与
upload-artifact@v7):

- 构建:Makefile 检测 gcc >= 16 并告警(libstratosphere 误编译会导致
  LDN 会话结束时死机,需 devkitA64 r29.2 / gcc 15.2.0);PACK 增加
  ldn_mitm.ovl 与 relay.cfg 的打包(见后续 overlay 提交)
- CI:固定 devkitpro/devkita64:20260219 镜像;checkout fetch-depth: 0
  (优先显示 tag,无 tag 时回退 commit 短哈希);容器内 git safe.directory;
  build.yml 增加工具链版本诊断;sdcard 产物 include-hidden-files
  (switch/.overlays 默认会被跳过);nightly 增加 workflow_dispatch
- release.yml:采用上游修复(permissions: contents:write、
  softprops/action-gh-release@v2 替代废弃的 create-release/
  upload-release-asset、容器内安装 zip)
- .gitignore、docs/relay.cfg.example 更新
- 新增 tools/relay_steal_test.py:中继隔离性测试工具
- README:夜间构建链接改为指向本 fork 的 workflows

Squashed from aylz10/ldn_mitm2 commits (author: dogty):
e5fc404, 2748c48 (CI fix), 5a87a46 (README link, adapted to this fork)

Ported-from: https://github.com/aylz10/ldn_mitm2/tree/beta/bsd-broadcast-relay-TONYX9000
